<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 2.31 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 2.31 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction January 14 versus January 7  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    89/96     180/187	 364/340</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   2.99/3.05  3.08/3.16     3.25/3.34</p>
<p> Highest yld     2.99/3.05  3.08/3.16     3.26/3.35</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     2.97/3.04  3.07/3.15     3.25/3.34</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million 1,075/760    495/705	 740/700</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  2,585/1,420  625/1,195     940/1,480</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 38,889 million markka, the STO said.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
